-- =====================================================================
-- Field Review System — mark exams completed from the OMR Tracker / 1a sheet  (26-Nov-2026)
-- Source: Academic_Targets_Done_Status.xlsx (Status = "Done").
-- Run in the Supabase SQL editor of the "Field Team Review System" project (xljnhbexevetzgaaehqc),
-- AFTER sql/2026-11-25-academic-exam-done.sql and after the Academic Plan is uploaded.
--
-- One row per DISTRICT exam (POs of the same district share it), so every PO, PM and DM of that
-- district sees the exam ticked "Completed" on the Monthly tab and G1 counts it.
--   exam_key  = district | program | test cycle (lower case, single spaces) - same key the page uses
--   counts_in = the exam's month in the Academic Plan (Fixed Date, else Preferred Month), so target
--               and done land in the same month
--   marked_by = "Import · <exam ID / source>" (shown under the tick)
-- Exams a PO has already ticked are left as they are (on conflict do nothing). Safe to run twice.
-- 263 exams.
-- =====================================================================

on conflict (exam_key) do nothing;

